    "name": "progress",
    "description": "For the main session alone: it feeds the progress bar over the input box and the crew panel while you coordinate work split across two or more subagent tasks. Send it once the plan is set (title, tasks, phase \"delegate\"), again whenever a task passes review (done), whenever the phase changes or the plan is revised (tasks), and a last time with finished: true. Any field you omit keeps the value it had. Calls made by a subagent are dropped; subagents use `step` instead."
   },
   {
    "name": "step",
